@startuml circuit-breaker
title Circuit breaker on requests to the bank (Resilience4j)
hide empty description

[*] --> Closed
Closed : POST /transactions, /payouts goes through,
Closed : the last 10 calls are counted
Open : no call, treated as connection refused:
Open : the bank created nothing
HalfOpen : one trial call

Closed --> Open : half of the last 10 calls failed, at least 5 calls\n(timeout, 5xx, no connection)
Open --> HalfOpen : the first call after 30 s
HalfOpen --> Closed : the trial call succeeded
HalfOpen --> Open : the trial call failed

legend bottom
  4xx is not a failure: it is the bank's answer.
  | Situation | Result |
  | open, still open after short retries | *Failed PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE + alert |
  | timeout / 5xx while closed | retry with the same externalId, then DLT |
  Metrics resilience4j_circuitbreaker_* → Grafana; an alert when open for 1 min.
end legend
@enduml
